static boolean[][] blocked = {
    {false, false, false},
    {false, true, false},
    {false, false, false}
};

public static int paths(int r, int c) {
    if (r < 0 || c < 0 || blocked[r][c]) {
        return 0;
    }
    if (r == 0 && c == 0) {
        return 1;
    }
    return paths(r - 1, c) + paths(r, c - 1);
}
```

```java
